{"seq":1,"slug":"pretraining-objectives","title":"预训练目标：从掩码语言模型到下一 Token 预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/pretraining/pretraining-objectives","wordCount":1158,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"预训练目标-从掩码语言模型到下一-token-预测\">预训练目标：从掩码语言模型到下一 Token 预测</h1><p>预训练目标定义了模型从海量无标注文本中&quot;学什么&quot;。它不仅决定了模型的能力边界——分类、生成、推理——也决定了架构选择和数据利用效率。从 BERT 的掩码语言模型到 GPT 的自回归预测，再到 T5 的 Span Corruption，每种目标背后都蕴含着对&quot;语言理解&quot;本质的不同假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>预训练目标可以按信息流方向分为三类：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PT[预训练目标] --&gt; AR[自回归 Autoregressive]&#10;    PT --&gt; AE[自编码 Autoencoding]&#10;    PT --&gt; S2S[序列到序列 Seq2Seq]&#10;    AR --&gt; CLM[Causal LM: 预测下一个 token]&#10;    AE --&gt; MLM[Masked LM: 恢复被遮蔽的 token]&#10;    S2S --&gt; SC[Span Corruption: 恢复被替换的片段]&#10;    CLM --&gt; GPT[GPT/Llama/Claude 系列]&#10;    MLM --&gt; BERT[BERT/RoBERTa/DeBERTa]&#10;    SC --&gt; T5[T5/UL2/Flan 系列]\">graph LR\n    PT[预训练目标] --&gt; AR[自回归 Autoregressive]\n    PT --&gt; AE[自编码 Autoencoding]\n    PT --&gt; S2S[序列到序列 Seq2Seq]\n    AR --&gt; CLM[Causal LM: 预测下一个 token]\n    AE --&gt; MLM[Masked LM: 恢复被遮蔽的 token]\n    S2S --&gt; SC[Span Corruption: 恢复被替换的片段]\n    CLM --&gt; GPT[GPT/Llama/Claude 系列]\n    MLM --&gt; BERT[BERT/RoBERTa/DeBERTa]\n    SC --&gt; T5[T5/UL2/Flan 系列]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标类型</th>\n<th>数学表达</th>\n<th>信息流</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Causal LM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{t=1}^{T} P(x_t \\mid x_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2809em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9812em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>单向（左到右）</td>\n<td>文本生成、对话、推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Masked LM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>∖</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\prod_{t \\in M} P(x_t \\mid x_{\\setminus M})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0771em;vertical-align:-0.3271em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∏</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1786em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\